body:
Hi @klemenoslaj ,

I tried to reproduce above issue but I couldn't. Application ran successfully. Details below:

`DemoComponent` from demo library module:

```javascript
import { Component, OnInit } from '@angular/core';

const enum Demo {
  First
}

@Component({
  selector: 'lib-demo',
  template: `
    <p>
    Static Variable: ${ Demo.First }
    </p>
  `,
  styles: []
})
export class DemoComponent implements OnInit {
  constructor() { }
  ngOnInit(): void {
  }
}

```

I built the demo library with `ng build demo --prod` option and then used it in AppComponent like this. (served with --aot)

```javascript
import { Component } from '@angular/core';

@Component({
  selector: 'app-root',
  template: `
    <lib-demo></lib-demo>
  `
})
export class AppComponent {}
```
 
My output:
Static Variable: 0

Environment:
```
